The saved H1 summary reports 2,735/18,398 under-30 transfers entering the PL (14.87%) and 147/1,314 older transfers (11.19%). It reports an observed gap of about -3.68 percentage points, a null mean around -2.41 points, and one-sided p = 0.045. The one-transfer-per-player check reports p = 0.044 from one fixed sample of 5,213 players. Those saved outcomes exist even though notes/findings.md and the earlier draft still leave H1 unfinished. Trace the JSON fields and code before finalising the numbers or interpretation.

